{"type":"text","timestamp":1790374734287,"sessionID":"ses_f255a0aaaffeMx1viSRuBBY5ay","part":{"id":"prt_0daa669b60012uFoCnDFtUn0zp","messageID":"msg_0daa63198001wrNaDwW79SaY8U","sessionID":"ses_f255a0aaaffeMx1viSRuBBY5ay","type":"text","text":"The project already has the hero and goblin groups in `main.tscn`, and `BattleUnit` is an `Area2D` with team layers 1 and 2. I’m matching the new range layer/mask scheme to those existing collision settings and will make the exported node references explicit in the scene.","time":{"start":1790374734262,"end":1790374734263},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0b37439dd2a9b9d9016ab6f34b936c8196b06df0ab41db3b59","phase":"commentary"}}}}
