{"type":"text","timestamp":1790374886443,"sessionID":"ses_f255a0aaaffeMx1viSRuBBY5ay","part":{"id":"prt_0daa8bc24001b7dAEjA3NvrXEE","messageID":"msg_0daa854210017ICEhOhhBp208o","sessionID":"ses_f255a0aaaffeMx1viSRuBBY5ay","type":"text","text":"Godot’s editor import and runtime checks pass. The first capture attempt failed because headless mode cannot render images; I’ll use the graphical renderer for the visual check. I’ll also check nearest-target selection and range entry/exit behavior. A 32-pixel base range puts `GoblinNear` inside the hero’s range and `GoblinFar` outside it in the supplied scene.","time":{"start":1790374886436,"end":1790374886438},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0b37439dd2a9b9d9016ab6f3dc8c4c819682bf05eb704a1940","phase":"commentary"}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790374886462,"sessionID":"ses_f255a0aaaffeMx1viSRuBBY5ay","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_784Crf3eJAvGHpJPRIJk3KQS","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: /workspace/custom_nodes/detect_range.gd\n@@\n-@export var base_range_size: float = 16.0\n+@export var base_range_size: float = 32.0\n*** Update File: /workspace/scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.tscn\n@@\n-base_range_size = 16.0\n+base_range_size = 32.0\n*** Add File: /workspace/scripts/verify_aggro.gd\n+extends SceneTree\n+\n+var changes := 0\n+\n+\n+func _initialize() -> void:\n+\tdebug_collisions_hint = true\n+\t_run.call_deferred()\n+\n+\n+func _settle() -> void:\n+\tfor frame in range(4):\n+\t\tawait physics_frame\n+\tawait process_frame\n+\n+\n+func _run() -> void:\n+\tvar main := load(\"res://scenes/main.tscn\").instantiate() as Node2D\n+\troot.add_child(main)\n+\tmain.position = Vector2(220, 220)\n+\tvar hero := main.get_node(\"HeroUnit\") as BattleUnit\n+\tvar near := main.get_node(\"GoblinNear\") as BattleUnit\n+\tvar far := main.get_node(\"GoblinFar\") as BattleUnit\n+\thero.target_finder.targets_in_range_changed.connect(func(): changes += 1)\n+\tawait _settle()\n+\n+\tassert(hero.detect_range.stats == hero.stats)\n+\tassert(hero.detect_range.collision_layer == 4)\n+\tassert(hero.detect_range.collision_mask == 2)\n+\tassert(near.detect_range.collision_layer == 8)\n+\tassert(near.detect_range.collision_mask == 1)\n+\tassert(hero.detect_range.col_shape.shape is CircleShape2D)\n+\tassert(is_equal_approx(hero.detect_range.col_shape.shape.radius, 96.0))\n+\tassert(is_equal_approx(near.detect_range.col_shape.shape.radius, 32.0))\n+\tassert(near.detect_range.col_shape.shape != far.detect_range.col_shape.shape)\n+\tassert(hero.target_finder.targets_in_range == [near])\n+\tassert(hero.target_finder.has_target_in_range())\n+\tassert(not near.target_finder.has_target_in_range())\n+\tassert(changes == 1)\n+\n+\tvar decoy := Area2D.new()\n+\tdecoy.collision_layer = 2\n+\tdecoy.collision_mask = 0\n+\tvar shape := CollisionShape2D.new()\n+\tshape.shape = CircleShape2D.new()\n+\tdecoy.add_child(shape)\n+\tmain.add_child(decoy)\n+\tdecoy.add_to_group(\"goblins\")\n+\tawait _settle()\n+\tassert(hero.target_finder.targets_in_range == [near])\n+\tassert(changes == 1)\n+\thero.target_finder.find_target()\n+\tnear.target_finder.find_target()\n+\tassert(hero.target_finder.target == near)\n+\tassert(near.target_finder.target == hero)\n+\n+\tnear.position = Vector2(220, 0)\n+\tawait _settle()\n+\tassert(not hero.target_finder.has_target_in_range())\n+\tassert(changes == 2)\n+\thero.target_finder.find_target()\n+\tassert(hero.target_finder.target == far)\n+\n+\tfar.position = Vector2(20, 0)\n+\tawait _settle()\n+\tassert(hero.target_finder.targets_in_range == [far])\n+\tassert(far.target_finder.targets_in_range == [hero])\n+\tassert(changes == 3)\n+\tnear.remove_from_group(\"goblins\")\n+\tfar.remove_from_group(\"goblins\")\n+\thero.target_finder.find_target()\n+\tassert(hero.target_finder.target == null)\n+\tnear.add_to_group(\"goblins\")\n+\tfar.add_to_group(\"goblins\")\n+\n+\tvar updated_stats := UnitStats.new()\n+\tupdated_stats.team = UnitStats.Team.ENEMY\n+\tupdated_stats.attack_range = 2\n+\thero.stats = updated_stats\n+\tassert(hero.detect_range.stats == hero.stats)\n+\tassert(hero.detect_range.collision_layer == 8)\n+\tassert(hero.detect_range.collision_mask == 1)\n+\tassert(is_equal_approx(hero.detect_range.col_shape.shape.radius, 64.0))\n+\thero.stats = load(\"res://data/units/bjorn.tres\")\n+\tnear.position = Vector2(70, 0)\n+\tfar.position = Vector2(140, 0)\n+\tdecoy.queue_free()\n+\tawait _settle()\n+\n+\tif DisplayServer.get_name() != \"headless\":\n+\t\tawait RenderingServer.frame_post_draw\n+\t\tvar image := root.get_texture().get_image()\n+\t\tassert(image.save_png(\"res://.godot/aggro_verification.png\") == OK)\n+\tprint(\"PASS: opposing groups, nearest targets, non-unit filtering, range signals, independent shapes, and stats updates\")\n+\tquit()\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM workspace/custom_nodes/detect_range.gd\nM workspace/scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.tscn\nA workspace/scripts/verify_aggro.gd","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /workspace/custom_nodes/detect_range.gd\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/custom_nodes/detect_range.gd\n+++ /workspace/custom_nodes/detect_range.gd\n@@ -1,9 +1,9 @@\n class_name DetectRange\n extends Area2D\n \n @export var col_shape: CollisionShape2D\n-@export var base_range_size: float = 16.0\n+@export var base_range_size: float = 32.0\n @export var stats: UnitStats: set = _set_stats\n \n \n func _set_stats(value: UnitStats) -> void:\n\nIndex: /workspace/scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.tscn\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.tscn\n+++ /workspace/scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.tscn\n@@ -20,9 +20,9 @@\n collision_layer = 4\n collision_mask = 2\n script = ExtResource(\"3_detect_range\")\n col_shape = NodePath(\"CollisionShape2D\")\n-base_range_size = 16.0\n+base_range_size = 32.0\n \n [node name=\"CollisionShape2D\" type=\"CollisionShape2D\" parent=\"DetectRange\"]\n \n [node name=\"TargetFinder\" type=\"Node\" parent=\".\" node_paths=PackedStringArray(\"actor\")]\n\nIndex: /workspace/scripts/verify_aggro.gd\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/scripts/verify_aggro.gd\n+++ /workspace/scripts/verify_aggro.gd\n@@ -0,0 +1,95 @@\n+extends SceneTree\n+\n+var changes := 0\n+\n+\n+func _initialize() -> void:\n+\tdebug_collisions_hint = true\n+\t_run.call_deferred()\n+\n+\n+func _settle() -> void:\n+\tfor frame in range(4):\n+\t\tawait physics_frame\n+\tawait process_frame\n+\n+\n+func _run() -> void:\n+\tvar main := load(\"res://scenes/main.tscn\").instantiate() as Node2D\n+\troot.add_child(main)\n+\tma