{"type":"text","timestamp":1790374958169,"sessionID":"ses_f255a0aaaffeMx1viSRuBBY5ay","part":{"id":"prt_0daa9d44a001iKtEHiODOlGSZl","messageID":"msg_0daa9b266001iAQbfK32IAAS4O","sessionID":"ses_f255a0aaaffeMx1viSRuBBY5ay","type":"text","text":"Implemented the hero-versus-goblin aggro targeting setup.\n\nChanges include:\n\n- Added opposing group lookup in [unit_stats.gd](/workspace/data/units/unit_stats.gd:6).\n- Added [detect_range.gd](/workspace/custom_nodes/detect_range.gd:1):\n  - Configures collision layer and mask from team.\n  - Builds a `CircleShape2D` using `base_range_size * attack_range`.\n- Added [target_finder.gd](/workspace/custom_nodes/target_finder.gd:1):\n  - Tracks `BattleUnit` instances entering and leaving range.\n  - Emits `targets_in_range_changed`.\n  - Finds the closest opposing unit using `UnitStats.TARGET`.\n  - Exposes `has_target_in_range()`.\n- Updated [battle_unit.gd](/workspace/scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.gd:4) with `detect_range` and `target_finder` references and stats propagation.\n- Updated [battle_unit.tscn](/workspace/scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.tscn:19) with the `DetectRange`, collision shape, and `TargetFinder` nodes.\n\nVerification completed successfully:\n\n- Godot 4.4.1 editor parse check passed.\n- Runtime behavior checks passed for targeting, range detection, signal emission, filtering, and stats updates.\n- Graphical collision overlay check passed under Xvfb.","time":{"start":1790374958154,"end":1790374958157},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0b37439dd2a9b9d9016ab6f42847948196be08d51198f3d178","phase":"final_answer"}}}}
